{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791400560, "covers_from": "2026-10-07T19:16:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-07T19:17:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791400620, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-07T19:16:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53176, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市東區商圈\n忠孝敦化站\n街友多\n垃圾亂丟\n煙蒂亂丟\n商圈沒落", "display_name": "大安代表 AnnyannyfengFeng", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T19:16:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3967, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "共用停車格有重機佔位 然後跟汽車互換\n重機移走後未停在停車格內的亂象\n有些人長期佔用停車格", "display_name": "北投代表 No.3,967", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T19:16:25+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 54977, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "早上捷運上班時段，龍山寺站都很難搭上車，是否能有解決方案", "display_name": "南港代表 No.54,977", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T19:16:34+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 23607, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "希望可以協調讓公車司機的班表，不要太過於急促，乘客坐好再開動、司機停好大家再下車，避免跌倒與急煞🥺", "display_name": "中正代表 No.23,607", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T19:16:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4760, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "臺北市狹窄的巷弄裡停滿了汽機車，通行困難外還可能影響救災車輛出入", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.4,760", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 3967, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.3,967", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 54977, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.54,977", "distr